---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Free Models Callout">
  <h1>Free Models Callout <span class="docs-tag">Callout</span></h1>
  <p class="docs-lead">A left-bordered informational callout box for rate-limit notices or contextual warnings on the free models page.</p>

  <h2>Preview</h2>
  <div class="docs-preview">
    
    <div class="free-models-callout">
      <p class="free-models-callout__box">
        Free tiers are subject to provider rate limits. Manifest retries automatically, but sustained high-volume workloads should use a paid plan.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>HTML</h2>
  <div class="docs-code"><pre>&lt;div class="free-models-callout"&gt;
  &lt;p class="free-models-callout__box"&gt;
    Free tiers are subject to provider rate limits. Manifest retries automatically,
    but sustained high-volume workloads should use a paid plan.
  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre></div>

  <h2>Class reference</h2>
  <table class="docs-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>.free-models-callout</td><td><span class="docs-tag">base</span></td><td style="color:var(--docs-text-muted)">Root wrapper with bottom xl padding</td></tr>
      <tr><td>.free-models-callout__box</td><td><span class="docs-tag docs-tag--element">element</span></td><td style="color:var(--docs-text-muted)">Alt-background box with a 3 px left border and rounded right corners, base font size</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</DocsLayout>
